  "id": "RAW_a9ad724c2e",
  "title": "8B 逆袭 32B！开源首个长程交互 SQL Agent 框架，面向真实数据库",
  "url": "https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI3MTA0MTk1MA==&mid=2652739675&idx=3&sn=90e941c875c03dc0dfc87141362d0db5",
  "date": "2026-11-02 17:05:00",
  "author": "新智元",
  "siteName": "新智元",
  "content": "<html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <p><span>新智元</span> <span>2026-11-02 17:05</span> <span style=\"display: inline-block;\">北京</span></p>\n  <p><img src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261102144254_9f86305.jpeg\"></p>\n  <h3 data-mpa-powered-by=\"yiban.io\" style=\"outline: 0px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);letter-spacing: 0.544px;font-family: -apple-system-font, system-ui, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;\">\n   <div data-tools=\"135编辑器\" data-id=\"88402\" style=\"outline: 0px;line-height: 27.2px;widows: 1;visibility: visible;\">\n    <div data-tools=\"135编辑器\" data-id=\"88402\" style=\"outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;line-height: 27.2px;visibility: visible;\">\n     <div data-style=\"line-height: 1.8; text-align: justify; font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0px; color: rgb(117, 114, 114);white-space: normal;\" style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible;\">\n      <div style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible;\">\n       <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;text-align: center;\"><span leaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.42424242424242425\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1584\" style=\"width: 100%;height: auto;\" data-croporisrc=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/Rvq8Ow69CYVwGUwlMzIiccibWnIYwiaF2VWhNnvasaWWzaGE6gibJJeicTo16clUibl8e7xFARmibTNyGDb7K3BsC34EqdpQ4yD4JdsSwUnVVfCPMU/0?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" data-cropselx1=\"0\" data-cropselx2=\"578\" data-cropsely1=\"0\" data-cropsely2=\"247\" data-imgfileid=\"505253063\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261102144254_d5e2632.png\"></span></p>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n  </h3>\n  <h3 style=\"outline: 0px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);letter-spacing: 0.544px;font-family: -apple-system-font, system-ui, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;\">\n   <div data-tools=\"135编辑器\" data-id=\"88402\" style=\"outline: 0px;line-height: 27.2px;widows: 1;visibility: visible;\">\n    <div data-tools=\"135编辑器\" data-id=\"88402\" style=\"outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;line-height: 27.2px;visibility: visible;\">\n     <div style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible;\">\n      <div style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible;\">\n       <p style=\"margin-top: -1.2em;margin-right: 8px;margin-left: 8px;outline: 0px;font-size: 17px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;\"><span style=\"outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 1px;visibility: visible;\"><strong style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 1em;font-family: inherit;text-decoration: inherit;visibility: visible;\"><span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 18px;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.4;font-family: inherit;font-weight: inherit;text-decoration: inherit;background-color: rgb(127, 127, 127);visibility: visible;\"><span leaf=\"\">新智元报道 &nbsp;</span></span></strong></span></p>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n  </h3>\n  <div powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);letter-spacing: 0.544px;font-family: -apple-system-font, system-ui, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;\">\n   <div style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible;\">\n    <div style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible;\">\n     <p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span leaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.06944444444444445\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"width: 100%;height: auto;\" data-cropselx1=\"0\" data-cropselx2=\"578\" data-cropsely1=\"0\" data-cropsely2=\"40\" data-backw=\"578\" data-backh=\"40\" data-imgfileid=\"505218218\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260717064332_e57fe10.png\"></span></p>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"text-align: justify;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;\">在企业级真实业务与复杂数据分析中，让大模型「一眼看穿数据库并写出完美SQL」，往往只是一个不切实际的幻想。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: justify;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;\">传统的Text-to-SQL大多将其简化为单轮文本生成：给定问题和静态Schema，让模型一步生成最终SQL。但现实数据库动辄包含上百张表、数千字段与百万级数据，资深分析师绝不会「单轮盲猜」，而是在CLI或IDE 中执行 `SHOW TABLES`、探查表结构（DDL）、跑试探性查询（Probe Query），并根据报错反复修正逻辑后才提交代码。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: justify;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;\">在Spider2.0、BIRD-Interact和LiveSQLBench等长程交互基准上，传统静态微调模型纷纷暴露致命短板：训练时只学会「直接写终点答案」，部署到交互环境（Harness）后却缺乏探索试错、状态追踪与错误恢复能力，极易陷入死循环或因报错崩溃——即</span></span><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;\">「训练与部署脱节」（Train–Deploy Mismatch）</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;\">。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: justify;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;\">针对这一瓶颈，港科大与微软等团队推出了</span></span><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;\">首个原生长程环境交互训练框架HarnessSQL</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;\">，在密闭沙盒与专用SQL Harness中进行长程轨迹监督微调（SFT）与执行奖励强化学习（RL）。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: justify;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;\">在Spider 2.0-SQLite 上，HarnessSQL仅凭8B参数即斩获45.2%执行准确率（近基线3倍），大幅超越32B专用模型（OmniSQL 14.8%、Arctic-Text2SQL 16.3%）与多智能体系统（MARS-SQL 12.6%），14B模型更达54.8%！</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: justify;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;margin-bottom: 0px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.25735294117647056\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1224\" data-width=\"1224\" data-height=\"315\" data-imgfileid=\"505253051\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261102144254_dcc48ce.png\"></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: left;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;margin-bottom: 0px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 12px;letter-spacing: 1px;color: rgb(136, 136, 136);\">论文链接：<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2610.12274\" target=\"_blank\">https://arxiv.org/abs/2610.12274</a></span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: left;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 12px;letter-spacing: 1px;color: rgb(136, 136, 136);\">开源代码：<a href=\"https://github.com/YangHaolin0526/HarnessSQL\" target=\"_blank\">https://github.com/YangHaolin0526/HarnessSQL</a></span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: justify;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;margin-bottom: 0px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.417578125\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"2560\" style=\"width: 100%;\" data-width=\"417\" data-height=\"174\" data-backw=\"562\" data-backh=\"235\" data-imgfileid=\"505253052\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261102144254_69285a7.png\"></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(143, 149, 158);\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 12px;letter-spacing: 1px;color: rgb(136, 136, 136);\">图1：从单轮Text-to-SQL到具备沙盒与专用Harness的交互式数据库Agent演进。</span></span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.5267857142857143\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"112\" style=\"width: 85px;height: 40px;\" data-imgfileid=\"505095291\" src=\"https://image.jido.dev/20251204131046_bea6b283\"></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-size: 19px;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">问题形式化与「训练-部署脱节」之谜</span></strong></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: justify;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;\">交互式Text-to-SQL可形式化为由执行环境契约（Execution Harness）调解的部分可观测马尔可夫决策过程（POMDP）。任务实例定义为四元组 x = (q, D, h, v)，分别对应自然语言指令q、底层数据库D、执行Harness h与隐藏真实验证器（ExecutionOracle）v。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: justify;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;\">在第t ∈ [1, T]轮交互中，智能体根据环境观测o_t∈O，由策略π_θ生成推理与工具调用行动a_t∈A，完整轨迹表述为：</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.12643678160919541\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"348\" data-width=\"348\" data-height=\"44\" data-imgfileid=\"505253049\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261102144254_7900970.png\"></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: justify;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;\">其中y为终止步提交的最终SQL，任务成败由联合奖励函数评估：</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.11557788944723618\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"398\" data-width=\"398\" data-height=\"46\" data-imgfileid=\"505253048\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261102144254_5031ab6.png\"></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: justify;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;\">其中，</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: justify;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;\">R_result(y, v)∈{0, 1}</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;\">：在真实数据库D上比对候选产物y与标准答案v的执行结果集外延等价性，打破表层字符匹配局限；</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: justify;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;\">R_protocol(τ, h)∈{0, 1}</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;\">：校验轨迹是否遵守Harness契约（只读权限、语法合规、无死循环且在T步内显式提交）。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: justify;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;\">然而，现有后训练框架大多仍停留在传统的静态监督损失：</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.13664596273291926\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"322\" data-width=\"322\" data-height=\"44\" data-imgfileid=\"505253050\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261102144254_bac43a7.png\"></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: justify;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;\">这种静态训练模式导致了三重核心脱节：</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: justify;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;\">1.</span></span><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;\">抹杀中间探索状态</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;\">：只将最终SQL作为目标，忽略了中间探测表结构与验证假设的交互过程；</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: justify;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;\">2.</span></span><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;\">面对执行反馈盲目</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;\">：训练时从未见过运行报错或空结果集，推理时一旦遇到报错极易崩溃；</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: justify;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;\">3.</span></span><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;\">缺乏动作边界约束</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;\">：模型不理解数据库CLI的权限边界与终止协议，易产生工具格式幻觉。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.5267857142857143\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"112\" style=\"width: 85px;height: 40px;\" data-imgfileid=\"505095291\" src=\"https://image.jido.dev/20251204131046_bea6b283\"></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-size: 19px;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">让智能体在真正的执行沙盒中淬炼</span></strong></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: justify;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;\">为打破上述脱节，HarnessSQL构建了三大基石：高保真密闭执行沙盒、极简SQL Harness契约，以及两阶段长程后训练流水线。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: justify;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;color: rgb(255, 104, 39);\">1.密闭SQL执行沙盒与蓝图合成</span></span></strong></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: justify;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;\">团队基于Spider 2.0-Lite（30个SQLite）与Spider 2.0-DBT（49个DuckDB，零损迁移至SQLite）构建了79个复杂数据库沙盒，并采用</span></span><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;\">SQL-First蓝图合成法</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;\">：先从活动引擎提取Schema、样本值与外键路径，采样出难度可控的可执行SQL，再反向生成自然语言问题与验证Oracle。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: justify;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;\">沙盒具备只读绑定、单语句约束与60秒超时保护，并通过语法、非空与语义变异测试（Mutation Tests）保障数据质量。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: justify;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;color: rgb(255, 104, 39);\">2. 专为SQL任务定制的极简Harness契约（DSH-SQL）</span></span></strong></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: justify;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;\">通用编程Agent的繁杂Bash工具易导致模型注意力涣散。HarnessSQL改造了DeepSeek-Harness（DSH），提炼出四元极简动作契约：</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: justify;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;\">sql_list_tables：枚举数据库内所有数据表及各自的数据行数；</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: justify;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;\">sql_schema：探查指定表的完整DDL定义、字段类型与真实采样数据；</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: justify;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;\">sql_exec：试探性执行只读SQL查询，获取前排真实输出或运行时错误堆栈；</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: justify;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;\">sql_submit：终极提交已验证正确的SQL产物并退出长程会话。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: justify;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;\">环境中间件同时内置三大护栏：</span></span><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;\">确定性行数截断</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;\">防止大输出撑爆上下文；</span></span><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;\">循环调用警示器</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;\">主动纠偏重复无效查询；</span></span><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;\">压力触发上下文压缩</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;\">确保长程探索保留核心事实。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: justify;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;color: rgb(255, 104, 39);\">3. 原生Harness两阶段后训练：SFT筑基+RL登顶</span></span></strong></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: justify;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;\">第一阶段：全轨迹长程SFT（冷启动）</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;\">。利用教师模型在沙盒中自主探索，筛选通过Oracle验证的优质多轮轨迹（平均11.8Ktokens、16轮交互、14次真实执行）进行全序列监督：</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.06944444444444445\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"720\" data-width=\"720\" data-height=\"50\" data-imgfileid=\"505253055\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261102144254_73774d0.png\"></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: justify;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;font-weight: bold;\">关键机制：</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;\">计算损失时，所有环境观测token（o_t）均被掩码忽略（Masked Out），仅在模型自身生成的推理、工具调用与最终提交上计算梯度，迫使模型学会根据环境反馈推演下一步行动。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: justify;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;\">第二阶段：执行奖励</span></span></strong><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;\">强化学习</span></span></strong><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;\">（自主进化）</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;\">。为赋予模型应对未知数据库的试错能力，HarnessSQL采用动态解耦裁剪策略优化（DAPO）在沙盒中持续对齐，计算轨迹组标准化优势：</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.3181818181818182\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"264\" data-width=\"264\" data-height=\"84\" data-imgfileid=\"505253054\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261102144254_80f13ea.png\"></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: justify;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;\">奖励信号完全依托隐藏Oracle的真实执行对比：结果等价且合规得1分，报错、超时或结果不符均得0分。不设任何人工中间奖励（Reward Shaping），倒逼模型探索出稳健的自纠错策略。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: justify;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;margin-bottom: 0px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.49921875\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"2560\" style=\"width: 100%;\" data-width=\"417\" data-height=\"208\" data-backw=\"562\" data-backh=\"280\" data-imgfileid=\"505253057\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261102144254_e510c67.png\"></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(143, 149, 158);\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 12px;letter-spacing: 1px;color: rgb(136, 136, 136);\">图2：HarnessSQL整体架构流水线与沙盒交互轨迹示例。</span></span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.5267857142857143\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"112\" style=\"width: 85px;height: 40px;\" data-imgfileid=\"505095291\" src=\"https://image.jido.dev/20251204131046_bea6b283\"></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-size: 19px;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">实验评测</span></strong></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: justify;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;\">团队在三大真实数据库基准上展开评测：域内长程交互基准</span></span><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;\">Spider 2.0-SQLite</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;\">、含用户模拟器的域外动态交互基准</span></span><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;\">BIRD-Interact Mini</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;\">，以及跨领域复杂推理基准</span></span><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;\">LiveSQLBench Base-Lite SQLite</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;\">。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: justify;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;\">对比基线涵盖通识编程模型（Qwen2.5-Coder-32B）、前沿SQL专用模型（OmniSQL 7B/32B、Arctic-Text2SQL 7B/32B）与多智能体系统（MARS-SQL 3×7B），统一采用</span></span><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;\">执行准确率（Execution Accuracy）</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;\">评估。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: justify;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;margin-bottom: 0px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.3481404958677686\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1936\" style=\"width: 100%;\" data-width=\"432\" data-height=\"150\" data-backw=\"562\" data-backh=\"196\" data-imgfileid=\"505253056\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261102144254_f9bf3d7.png\"></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(143, 149, 158);\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 12px;letter-spacing: 1px;color: rgb(136, 136, 136);\">表1：三大基准上的执行准确率对比，粗体为最优，下划线为次优。</span></span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: justify;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;\">实验呈现出三大核心结果：</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: justify;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;\">1.&nbsp;</span></span><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;\">8B小模型全面反超32B模型</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;\">：在Spider 2.0-SQLite上，HarnessSQL-8B达到</span></span><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;\">45.2%</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;\">，较同底座基线（15.5%）提升近3倍，大幅超越OmniSQL-32B（14.8%）、Arctic-Text2SQL-32B（16.3%）和Qwen2.5-Coder-32B（16.3%）。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: justify;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;\">2.&nbsp;</span></span><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;\">14B模型逼近55%大关</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;\">：扩展至Qwen3-14B后，执行准确率进一步攀升至</span></span><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;\">54.8%</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;\">，验证了原生Harness训练出色的规模扩展性。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: justify;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;\">3.&nbsp;</span></span><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;\">强劲的域外泛化能力</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;\">：在未见过的BIRD-Interact Mini与LiveSQLBench上，HarnessSQL同样遥遥领先。其中在LiveSQLBench上，8B（24.8%）与14B（28.5%）达到所有32B基线（7.0%–8.9%）的3～4倍，证明模型习得了通用探索策略而非机械记忆Schema。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.5267857142857143\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"112\" style=\"width: 85px;height: 40px;\" data-imgfileid=\"505095291\" src=\"https://image.jido.dev/20251204131046_bea6b283\"></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-size: 19px;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">进阶剖析</span></strong></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: justify;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;\">面对交互环境任务，该直接做强化学习（Direct RL）还是先做轨迹微调（SFT）？受控实验给出了清晰对比：</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: justify;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.43731778425655976\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"686\" style=\"width:100%;\" data-width=\"179\" data-height=\"78\" data-backw=\"562\" data-backh=\"246\" data-imgfileid=\"505253053\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261102144254_5dac706.png\"></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: justify;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;\">冷启动直接RL提升有限</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;\">：8B基座直接跑RL仅从15.5%微升至20.0%（+4.5%）。缺乏交互先验时，稀疏二值奖励难以在长轨迹中有效分配信用。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: justify;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;\">全轨迹SFT奠定交互基础</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;\">：经验证轨迹SFT后，8B和14B分别跃升至</span></span><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;\">30.4%</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;\">（+14.9%）与</span></span><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;\">37.8%</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;\">（+15.6%），快速掌握了工具调用与报错纠偏规范。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: justify;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;\">SFT+RL实现性能质变</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;\">：在SFT基础上引入DAPO强化学习，8B再涨14.8%达</span></span><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;\">45.2%</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;\">，14B再涨17.0%达</span></span><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;\">54.8%</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;\">（增益达直接RL的3倍以上）。这确立了长程Agent的黄金范式：</span></span><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;\">SFT赋予交互框架与探索常识，RL释放未知环境下的自适应寻优潜能。</span></span></strong></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.5267857142857143\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"112\" style=\"width: 85px;height: 40px;\" data-imgfileid=\"505095291\" src=\"https://image.jido.dev/20251204131046_bea6b283\"></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-size: 19px;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">四大消融实验</span></strong></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: justify;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;\">围绕长程Agent训练的关键设计选择，消融实验提炼出四项核心发现：</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: justify;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;color: rgb(255, 104, 39);\">启示一：训练与推理接口的强对齐（Training-Inference Alignment）</span></span></strong></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: justify;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;\">若推理采用DSH-SQL交互环境，但训练使用非交互式（Non-harness）SFT数据，Spider2.0准确率仅</span></span><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;\">9.6%</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;\">，甚至低于未微调基座（15.5%）；而原生HarnessSFT达</span></span><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;\">30.4%</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;\">。这证明：</span></span><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;\">静态训练会破坏模型与动态环境的协作，训练与部署环境必须严格同构。</span></span></strong></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: justify;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;margin-bottom: 0px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.20927152317880796\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1510\" style=\"width: 100%;\" data-width=\"432\" data-height=\"90\" data-backw=\"562\" data-backh=\"118\" data-imgfileid=\"505253059\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261102144254_856f6c3.png\"></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(143, 149, 158);\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 12px;letter-spacing: 1px;color: rgb(136, 136, 136);\">非交互式与原生Harness训练和推理在域内及域外基准上的交叉消融对比。</span></span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: justify;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;color: rgb(255, 104, 39);\">启示二：全序列轨迹组织显著优于单步拆解（Full-Trajectory&gt;Turn-Split）</span></span></strong></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: justify;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;\">构建SFT数据时，保留完整轨迹上下文的全序列监督（Full-trajectory）在三大基准上全面优于单步拆解（Turn-split）。长程任务高度依赖前后多轮的因果脉络，拆碎样本会割裂全局决策连贯性。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: justify;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;margin-bottom: 0px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.6007359705611776\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"2174\" style=\"width: 100%;\" data-width=\"345\" data-height=\"207\" data-backw=\"562\" data-backh=\"338\" data-imgfileid=\"505253058\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261102144254_b50c968.png\"></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(143, 149, 158);\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 12px;letter-spacing: 1px;color: rgb(136, 136, 136);\">图3：全轨迹监督（Full-trajectory）显著优于单步拆解监督（Turn-split）。</span></span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: justify;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;color: rgb(255, 104, 39);\">启示三：超长上下文容量是长程探索的生命线（8K-&gt;16K-&gt;32K）</span></span></strong></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: justify;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;\">真实数据库探查伴随密集Schema与中间结果反馈，轨迹动辄上万tokens。当训练与推理上下文从8K扩展至16K和32K时，Spider2.0准确率从</span></span><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;\">27.4%跃升至45.2%</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;\">——截断早期历史等同于剥夺模型的复盘与溯源记忆。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: justify;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;margin-bottom: 0px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.662007623888183\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1574\" style=\"width: 100%;\" data-width=\"345\" data-height=\"228\" data-backw=\"562\" data-backh=\"372\" data-imgfileid=\"505253061\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261102144254_ade4cbd.png\"></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(143, 149, 158);\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 12px;letter-spacing: 1px;color: rgb(136, 136, 136);\">图4：上下文窗口长度对执行准确率的影响，32K上下文带来显著提升。</span></span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: justify;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;color: rgb(255, 104, 39);\">启示四：DAPO</span></span></strong><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;color: rgb(255, 104, 39);\">算法</span></span></strong><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;color: rgb(255, 104, 39);\">更加契合稀疏奖励下的长程策略优化</span></span></strong></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: justify;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.2504012841091493\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1246\" style=\"width:100%;\" data-width=\"264\" data-height=\"66\" data-backw=\"562\" data-backh=\"141\" data-imgfileid=\"505253060\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261102144254_bf8deb9.png\"></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: justify;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;\">在相同预算与沙盒下对比GRPO（40.7%）、GSPO（43.7%）与DAPO（</span></span><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;\">45.2%</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;\">），DAPO表现最优。其动态过滤零方差轨迹组、解耦裁剪范围与全批次token归一化机制，有效缓解了稀疏奖励下的策略震荡。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.5267857142857143\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"112\" style=\"width: 85px;height: 40px;\" data-imgfileid=\"505095291\" src=\"https://image.jido.dev/20251204131046_bea6b283\"></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-size: 19px;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">值得关注的边界与未来演进</span></strong></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: justify;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;\">团队也客观指出了当前系统的演进方向：</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: justify;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;\">1.</span></span><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;\">跨数据库方言扩展</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;\">：从当前的SQLite生态进一步拓展至Snowflake、BigQuery、PostgreSQL等企业级云原生方言，构建更完善的权限隔离与生态适配。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: justify;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;\">2.</span></span><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;\">多模态与多元分析工具</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;\">：除命令行查询外，进一步融合可视化图表、文档报告与交互式BI仪表盘等多元分析环境。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.5267857142857143\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"112\" style=\"width: 85px;height: 40px;\" data-imgfileid=\"505095291\" src=\"https://image.jido.dev/20251204131046_bea6b283\"></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-size: 19px;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">总结与展望</span></strong></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: justify;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;\">大模型正加速从「对话助手」走向「自主执行智能体」。HarnessSQL证明：</span></span><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;\">面对需要工具调用与试错反馈的复杂任务，仅灌输静态「正确答案」远远不够，必须将交互环境（Harness）纳入核心训练闭环，让模型在动态环境中原生习得长程探索与容错能力。</span></span></strong></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: justify;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;\">目前，HarnessSQL的代码、沙盒环境与合成轨迹资产已全部在GitHub开源，为Text-to-SQL、数据库智能体与通用Agent研发提供了可直接复用的标杆参考。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-right: 8px;margin-left: 8px;min-height: 1em;font-family: -apple-system-font, system-ui, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;margin-bottom: 0px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(136, 136, 136);letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 12px;\"><span leaf=\"\">参考资料：</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-right: 8px;margin-left: 8px;min-height: 1em;font-family: -apple-system-font, system-ui, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;margin-bottom: 0px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(136, 136, 136);letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 12px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2610.12274\" target=\"_blank\">https://arxiv.org/abs/2610.12274</a></span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-right: 8px;margin-left: 8px;min-height: 1em;font-family: -apple-system-font, system-ui, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;margin-bottom: 0px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(136, 136, 136);font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 12px;letter-spacing: 1px;text-align: center;\"><span leaf=\"\">编辑：LRST</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-right: 8px;margin-bottom: 0px;margin-left: 8px;min-height: 1em;font-family: -apple-system-font, system-ui, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 14px;\"><strong style=\"font-family: -apple-system-font, system-ui, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-align: center;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span leaf=\"\">秒追ASI</span></strong></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-right: 8px;margin-bottom: 0px;margin-left: 8px;min-height: 1em;font-family: -apple-system-font, system-ui, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><strong style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-align: center;\"><span leaf=\"\">⭐</span></strong><strong style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-align: center;\"><span leaf=\"\">点赞、转发、在看一键三连</span></strong><strong style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-align: center;\"><span leaf=\"\">⭐</span></strong></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-right: 8px;margin-bottom: 0px;margin-left: 8px;min-height: 1em;font-family: -apple-system-font, system-ui, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong style=\"letter-spacing: 0.544px;font-size: 15px;text-align: center;\"><span leaf=\"\">点亮星标，锁定新智元极速推送！</span></strong></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;margin-bottom: 24px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.2111111111111111\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"jpeg\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"width: 100%;height: auto;\" data-backw=\"578\" data-backh=\"122\" data-imgfileid=\"505133683\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260717064332_62aefa3.jpeg\"></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;margin-bottom: 0px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.6129629629629629\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"width: 100%;height: auto;\" data-backw=\"578\" data-backh=\"354\" data-imgfileid=\"505251070\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261016234858_1d4f190.png\"></span></p>\n  <p style=\"display: none;\"><mp-style-type data-value=\"3\"></mp-style-type></p>\n </body>\n</html>",
  "aiSummary": "港科大与微软团队提出的首个原生长程交互 SQL Agent 框架 HarnessSQL，通过在密闭沙盒中进行轨迹监督微调与强化学习，8B 模型在 Spider 2.0-SQLite 上达到 45.2%执行准确率，显著超越 32B 专用模型，证明了交互式训练范式对复杂数据库任务的强大提升效果。",
  "oneSentenceSummary": "港科大与微软团队提出的首个原生长程交互 SQL Agent 框架 HarnessSQL，通过在密闭沙盒中进行轨迹监督微调与强化学习，8B 模型在 Spider 2.0-SQLite 上达到 45.2%执行准确率，显著超越 32B 专用模型，证明了交互式训练范式对复杂数据库任务的强大提升效果。",
  "summary": "本文介绍了 HarnessSQL 框架，这是首个专为长程交互 SQL 任务设计的训练体系。传统 Text-to-SQL 模型在实际数据库中面临「训练与部署脱节」问题，缺乏探索试错与错误恢复能力。HarnessSQL 构建了 79 个复杂数据库沙盒，采用 SQL-First 蓝图合成法，定义了四元极简动作契约（sql_list_tables、sql_schema、sql_exec、sql_submit），并通过两阶段训练：全轨迹 SFT 筑基+DAPO 强化学习登顶。实验显示，8B 模型仅凭 HarnessSQL 训练即可超越 32B 专用模型，14B 模型更达 54.8%准确率，且在 BIRD-Interact Mini 等域外基准上也遥遥领先，证明了通用探索策略的有效性。",
  "mainPoints": [
    {
      "point": "HarnessSQL 通过交互式训练解决了 SQL Agent 的「训练与部署脱节」问题",
      "explanation": "传统模型只学习生成最终 SQL，部署时遇到报错无法恢复；HarnessSQL 在密闭沙盒中进行全轨迹监督微调和执行奖励强化学习，使模型掌握探索试错、状态追踪和错误恢复能力。"
    },
    {
      "point": "8B 小模型凭 Harness 训练成果超越 32B 专用模型",
      "explanation": "在 Spider 2.0-SQLite 基准上，HarnessSQL-8B 达到 45.2%执行准确率，显著高于 OmniSQL-32B（14.8%）、Arctic-Text2SQL-32B（16.3%）和 Qwen2.5-Coder-32B（16.3%），证明了训练范式的价值。"
    },
